Package: colistream
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Colibristream Team <dev@colibristream.run>
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), curl, python3
Description: Bare-Metal Multi-Model AI Engine & High-Performance Swarm Runtime
 Colibristream enables consumer machines with 16-24GB VRAM to run massive
 models (72B to 2.4T MoE) and concurrent intra-family swarms with weights
 stored 1x in shared memory.
